    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1975464385075204114",
      "url": "https://x.com/followlastma/status/1975464385075204114",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1975464385075204114",
      "text": "[8:23AM] \n#AgegeMotorRd\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nWe are having smooth movement from Bolade-Oshodi, Brown junction down to Goro/Oshodi underneath the bridge.\n\nOshodiOke bridge descending through Goro by Terminal 2 is good.\n\nUnderneath the bridge to ascend Oshodi oke bridge by Terminal 1 is in good shape as well.\nOlupese Cappa Challenge down to Ojuwoye is quietly moving fine.\n\nOjuwoye to connect Isolo road, Onilegogoro, Palm avenue moving towards Daleko bridge and lasutech is moving as expected.\n\nLikewise the return journey from Daleko bridge back to Pako junction is good.\n Slow and steady movement from Alasalatu moving towards Mushin Ile epo isale due to the intersection.\n\nTotal filling station moving towards luth junction,  Olosha, Idi oro down to Moshalasi is moving as expected.\n\nThe return journey from Moshalasi back to Oshodi underneath the bridge inward arena is looking good.\n\nOur Officers are on ground doing the needful.\n#FollowLASTMA",
